  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. Set aside.\n• Cut sweet potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut beetroot into 1cm chunks. Trim Fioretto. Halve any thicker stalks of Fioretto lengthways. Zest lemon and slice into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-e334e400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place sweet potato, carrot and beetroot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to cool slightly.\n• TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when you can pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-2af98910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 15 minutes remaining, place Fioretto on a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender and brown around the edges, 10-15 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-aa61f120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat, then add dried oregano, lemon zest, the honey and a splash of water, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-9c4ef530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with Fioretto, squeeze over some lemon juice.\n• To the tray with veggies, add spinach & rocket mix and a drizzle of vinegar. Gently toss to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-32848f40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon Greek-style yoghurt around the base of serving bowls.\n• Divide root veggies between bowls. Top with lemon-herb haloumi and roasted Fioretto.\n• Dollop with babaganoush. Tear over mint and serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f85270cade9b9f0ace405a/step-1e55f850.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
